Rev 11:1 , The two witnesses prophesy;
Rev 11:6 , They have power to shut heaven, that it rain not;
Rev 11:7 , The beast shall fight against them, and kill them;
Rev 11:8 , They lie unburied;
Rev 11:11 , and after three and a half days rise again;
Rev 11:14 , The second woe is past;
Rev 11:15 , The seventh trumpet sounds.
